Helianthus Modbus Documentation License Policy

This repository uses two publication lanes.

The SPDX identifiers and complete legal texts incorporated by reference are:

- CC0-1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
- AGPL-3.0-only: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.txt

1. Protocol knowledge

Material under `protocols/`, `devices/`, `evidence/`, and `re-notes/` that
defines public protocol behavior, wire formats, interoperability requirements,
or redacted evidence is released under CC0-1.0.

2. Helianthus implementation documentation

Repository policy, development guidance, CI tooling, and Helianthus-specific
architecture or API guidance are released under AGPL-3.0-only unless a more
specific file notice applies.

Inbound contribution rule:

Contributors must submit only material that can be published under its
applicable lane. Never submit credentials, account data, private addresses,
full device fingerprints, or material that cannot be legally published.
